# AICL Example: Rock Paper Scissors
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Winner

Layer:
Core

Behavior Winner
    Input: p1, p2
    Output: result
    Action:
        if p1 == p2:
            return "draw"
        if p1 == "rock":
            if p2 == "scissors":
                return "p1"
            return "p2"
        if p1 == "paper":
            if p2 == "rock":
                return "p1"
            return "p2"
        if p2 == "paper":
            return "p1"
        return "p2"
